---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Volunteer — Base Impact" description="Volunteer with Base Impact to help neighbors get connected and help small nonprofits keep their technology working.">
  <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-body mb-4 fade-in">Volunteer</h1>
  <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-6 text-muted leading-relaxed fade-in">
    <p>Base Impact runs on volunteer energy. If you have skills to share — or just want to help — we'd love to have you.</p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-body mt-6">Ways to volunteer</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
      <li><strong>Tech setup</strong> — Help neighbors set up devices, internet, and accounts.</li>
      <li><strong>Digital skills training</strong> — Walk people through housing portals, job applications, and benefits.</li>
      <li><strong>Nonprofit support</strong> — Help small community groups with security, backups, and basic IT.</li>
      <li><strong>Resource verification</strong> — Visit local organizations and confirm what services they offer.</li>
      <li><strong>Directory maintenance</strong> — Help keep resource listings accurate and up to date.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-body mt-6">No experience needed</h2>
    <p>We'll train you. What matters most is patience, kindness, and a willingness to help.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-lg bg-fill px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-on-fill hover:bg-fill-hover">Get involved</a>
  </div>
</Base>
